[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An equestrian prodigy from Australia. Arena won the silver medalist at the previous tournament in Japan since then, she trained double to win the gold this year. She is Rena's rival usually seen arguing with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her great stature, arrogant and strict appearance, voluptuous figure, and the fact that she always carries a whip in her hands has caused all her male fans to give her the nickname \"The Ice Rider\". She has a queen's temperament, high pride, and usually looks down on others. However, despite her apperance and her attitude, she is very kind and friendly to the people she really cares about and/or recognizes her abilities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Strangely, since she met Kazuki, Arena has a soft spot for him, she always shows a very feminine and kind side to him... when he doesn't do something stupid."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Consider it an honor to be able to ride by my side Kazuki-donno\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47988"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"オーストラリア出身の、馬術競技選手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前回大会の銀メダリストでこの時期、オクルスの招待選手として日本を訪れていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷たく見えるキツめの表情と、グラビアもこなす抜群のプロポーション。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手に持った鞭に叩かれたいという歪んだファンも覆い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女王様気質でプライドが高く、他人を見下しているところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし実力を認めた人間には敬意を表し、礼儀正しい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5289","sourceWorkId":"17444","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"オーストラリア出身の馬術競技選手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前回大会の銀メダリストで、この時期、オクルスの招待選手として日本を訪れていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷たく見えるキツめの表情と、グラビアもこなす抜群のプロポーションをもつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手に持った鞭で叩かれたいという歪んだファンも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女王気質でプライドが高く、他人を見下しているところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし実力を認めた人間には敬意を表し、礼儀正しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「このアリーナ・ドーソンの椅子になれているのだから、光栄だろう？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45407"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"97 cm","valueContext":null